    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d712">

                <pb facs="0687" n="681" sameAs="frus:frus1894app1/pg681"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Gresham to Baron
                            Ketteler.</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Department of State</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1893-08-10"><hi rendition="#italic">August 10,
                        1893</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Sir</hi>: I have the honor to acknowledge the receipt
                    of Mr. von Holleben’s note of the 8th ultimo in regard to the appointment of Mr.
                    Schmidt, lately vice-consul of Germany at Apia, as president of the municipal
                    council.</p>
                <p>In confirmation of my telegram of the 3d instant, it gives me pleasure to state
                    that this Government cordially concurs in this appointment and that a note in
                    this sense has been addressed to the British ambassador.</p>
                <p>The other questions presented in your note shall have attentive
                    consideration.</p>
                <p>Accept, etc.,</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">W. Q. Gresham.</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
